&#x201C;As a new mom, balancing everything important to me can be a lot,&#x201D; says the content creator and BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic influencer partner. BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic is FDA approved to temporarily improve the look of moderate to severe frown lines, crow&#x2019;s feet, forehead lines and vertical bands connecting the neck and jaw (platysma bands) in adults. &#x201C;I love doing things that prioritize self-care. A consultation for BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic is one of those things. Every time I see my provider and get treated, I know I will still look like me, just with fewer lines.&#x201D;

The &#x201C;One & Only&#x201D; campaign builds on the foundation of BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic celebrating real people and real stories. Now, &#x201C;One & Only&#x201D; takes that message forward by celebrating the idea of being distinct. Each story is unique. &#x201C;The one & only BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic. The one & only you,&#x201D; the campaign emphasizes.&#xA0;

Treatment with BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic can deliver natural-looking results and help make lines less noticeable. That&#x2019;s the heart of the &#x201C;One & Only&#x201D; campaign: With BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic, you&#x2019;re still you, just with fewer lines. blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-dsk-tab-mid-article2-uid1' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["mid","mid-article2","mid-articleX"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-article2") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[2,4],[4,2],[620,366],[300,450]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

In two clinical trials, a majority of patients reported they were &#x201C;Mostly or Very Satisfied&#x201D; with their overall treatment results at day 60. In addition, these patients reported the same responses for the natural-looking result of treatment for their frown and forehead lines. In a 2022 survey, a majority of respondents treated for their crow&#x2019;s feet lines said they &#x201C;Completely or Somewhat Agree&#x201D; that BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic provides natural-looking results.

&#x201C;For me, life has never been about perfection. It&#x2019;s about authenticity and feeling like myself,&#x201D; Jensen shares. &#x201C;Taking ownership over how I show up in the world makes me feel unique and true to myself. With BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic, my provider can treat my moderate to severe frown lines, forehead lines, and crow&#x2019;s feet &#x2014; I am confident about my results* after getting treated and am happy with the natural-looking results BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic provides. It&#x2019;s not about changing who I am. It&#x2019;s about prioritizing myself through every stage of life. I&#x2019;m glad I had a consultation with my provider, who helped me understand that there are risks with this product as well. The effects of BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic may spread hours to weeks after injection and can cause serious symptoms, so don&#x2019;t forget to speak to your provider to see if it&#x2019;s right for you.&#x201D;

*Based on a 2025 study of experienced neurotoxin users (n = 512) in which 263 patients had received BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic within the last 6 months. When asked if they feel confident in their results after BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic treatment, 95% responded "Agree/Strongly Agree."

BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic is the first FDA approved product of its kind to temporarily improve the look of moderate to severe frown lines, forehead lines and crow&#x2019;s feet in adults. Not only has the nonsurgical prescription treatment been FDA approved for more than two decades, but it&#x2019;s also the most researched, tested and peer-reviewed treatment of its kind* &#x2014; even becoming the first FDA approved neurotoxin for use beyond the face (BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic temporarily improves the look of moderate to severe vertical bands connecting the neck and jaw).

*Over 6,800 publications featuring BOTOX&#xAE; (onabotulinumtoxinA) or BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic.

&#x201C;The &#x2018;One & Only&#x2019; campaign was launched to mark a new chapter for BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic, building on our brand&#x2019;s 20-year legacy as the most researched and trusted product of its kind 1,*,+ ,&#x201D; says Glen Curran, Senior Vice President of U.S., Allergan Aesthetics. &#x201C;We created this campaign to highlight real people and their stories. Our goal is to empower patients to embrace the one and only version of themselves while sharing the brand's position as the original, and the one and only, product of its kind that&#x2019;s been FDA approved for over 20 years.&#x201D; blogherads.adq.push(function () { blogherads .defineSlot( 'medrec', 'gpt-variety-article-mid-articleX-uid2' ) .setTargeting( 'pos', ["btf","mid-articleX","mid"] ) .setTargeting( 'viewable', 'yes' ) .setSubAdUnitPath("ros\/mid-articleX") .addSize([[320,480],[300,250],[300,251],[620,366]]) .setClsOptimization("minsize") ; });

