BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic continues to lead the aesthetics industry as the most requested product of its kind with 95% of specialists who would choose it and millions of patients treated, according to a July 2023 study*.

*Based on a 2023 online survey of 120 healthcare providers.

&#x201C;BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic is the most researched neurotoxin on the market*, so I trust it to deliver the precise, predictable results I want*,&#x201D; Jensen says. &#x201C;I&#x2019;m thoughtful about what I put into and on my body, and I like knowing BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic has been studied for decades. When treated by a licensed provider who is an expert in facial anatomy, the results are subtle. People in my life only notice I have less lines, but I still look like me. That&#x2019;s exactly how I want to show up, like myself.&#x201D;

*Over 6,800 publications featuring BOTOX&#xAE; (onabotulinumtoxinA) or BOTOX&#xAE; Cosmetic.

